 "description": "<p>A polyester teddy with the rabbit tail attached, in black, with a genuine three-size run and printed measurements - the most specified fitting in the bunny category. M runs 48 cm long for 40-50 kg, L runs 54 cm for 50-60 kg, XL runs 57 cm for 60-65 kg.</p>\n<p>Each size carries its own numbers: bust 60-100 cm on M, 70-110 on L, 80-120 on XL, with waist ranges following suit. The open-front cut is built in, and the tail is sewn rather than clipped.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Material: polyester</li>\n<li>Item type: teddy with sleeves</li>\n<li>Features: attached rabbit tail, open front</li>\n<li>Color: black</li>\n<li>Sizing: M (40-50 kg), L (50-60 kg), XL (60-65 kg) with per-size measurements</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Order by the printed chart, not by instinct. This is the listing for buyers who want numbers before they want a costume.</p>\n",
 "short_description": "<p>Black rabbit-tail teddy with sleeves in three measured sizes, M to XL with per-size bust and length specs.</p>\n",
